          "id": "p1-1",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Hi. Can I help you?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "I’d like to find out if you have any excursions suitable for families."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Sure. How about taking your family for a cruise? We have a steamship that takes passengers out several times a day - it’s over 100 years old."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "That sounds interesting. How long is the trip?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-5",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "About an hour and a half. And don’t forget to take pictures of the mountains. They’re all around you when you’re on the boat and they look fantastic."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-6",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "OK. And I assume there’s a café or something on board?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-7",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Sure. How old are your children?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-8",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "Er, my daughter’s fifteen and my son’s seven."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-9",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Right. Well there are various things you can do once you’ve crossed the lake, to make a day of it. One thing that’s very popular is a visit to the Country Farm. You’re met off the boat by the farmer and he’ll take you to the holding pens, where the sheep are kept. Children love feeling them!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-10",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "My son would love that. He really likes animals."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-11",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Well, there’s also a 40-minute trek round the farm on a house, if he wants."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-12",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "Do you think he’d manage it? He hasn’t done that before."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-13",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Sure. It’s suitable for complete beginners."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-14",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "Ah, good."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-15",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "And again, visitors are welcome to explore the farm on their own, as long as they take care to close gates and so on. There are some very beautiful gardens along the side of the lake which also belong to the farm - they’ll be just at their best now. You could easily spend an hour or two there."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-16",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "OK. Well that all sounds good. And can we get lunch there?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-17",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "You can, and it’s very good, though it’s not included in the basic cost. You pay when you get there."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-18",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "Right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-19",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "So is there anything else to do over on that side of the lake?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-20",
          "speaker": "Tc Employee",
          "text": "Well, what you can do is take a bike over on the ship and then go on a cycling trip. There’s a trail there called the Back Road - you could easily spend three or four hours exploring it, and the scenery’s wonderful. They’ll give you a map when you get your ticket for the cruise - there’s no extra charge."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-21",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "What’s the trail like in terms of difficulty?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-22",
