          "text": "Quite challenging in places. It wouldn’t be suitable for your seven-year-old. It needs someone who’s got a bit more experience."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-23",
          "speaker": "Visitor",
          "text": "Hmm. Well, my daughter loves cycling and so do I, so maybe the two of us could go, and my wife and son could stay on the farm. That might work out quite well. But we don’t have bikes here… is there somewhere we could rent them?"
        },
