          "id": "p3-6",
          "speaker": "Joe",
          "text": "Uhuh."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-7",
          "speaker": "Katie",
          "text": "So I thought I’d start with Giannetti, who’s professor of film and literature, and in one of his books he came up with a straightforward classification of film adaptations based on how faithful they are to the original plays and novels."
