          "id": "p3-8",
          "speaker": "Joe",
          "text": "Right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-9",
          "speaker": "Katie",
          "text": "I’ve already made some notes on that, so I just need to sort those out before the presentation. I thought that next I’d ask the class to come up with the worst examples of Shakespeare adaptations that they’ve seen, and to say why. That should be more fun than having their favourite versions."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-10",
          "speaker": "Joe",
