        },
        {
          "id": "p3-21",
          "speaker": "Joe",
          "text": "OK. I hope you’re going to talk about the 1993 film of Much Ado About Nothing. I think that’s one of the best Shakespeare films. It really brings the play to life, doesn’t it?"
